> > > > > > cyclic=TRUE, hyper=hyperprec, scale.model=FALSE,
> > > > > > adjust.for.con.comp=TRUE))
> > > > > >
> > > > > > I guess I'm looking for some insights about what the
> > > > > > ramifications of not scaling the latent effects would be and
> > > > > > to ask if there is any plan to allow group effects to bhave
> > > > > > scaled latent effects and be cyclic.
