Subject: Question about Rue et al. 2009 INLA paper
Message-ID: <YtozCliM7Js.rmejCq2CCwAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/r-inla-discussion-group/c/YtozCliM7Js/m/rmejCq2CCwAJ>
